  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You can use a reaction when you harm a creature or are harmed to give voice to a terrible scream. Each creature within 5 yards of you makes a @[wil] roll. On a failure, the creature becomes frightened of you until the end of your next turn. Then, for 1 minute, you roll to attack with 1 boon. You can use this talent once, twice at level 3, and three times at level 7. You regain expended uses after you rest.</p>",
